2:59:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:45:36Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2016 年 9 月安全更新 MS16-120（对应 KB 编号：Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 为 KB3185330，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 为 KB3185331，Windows 10 原始版为 KB3185614、1511 版为 KB3189866、1607 版为 KB3185611，Windows Vista/Server 2008 为 KB3175024），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录且存在公开利用代码，无法立即打补丁时应限制用户访问不可信网站，并禁用 ActiveX 控件和脚本在受限站点区域中的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036988","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-120","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-3393","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-3393.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2016/3xxx/CVE-2016-3393.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-3393","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2016/3xxx/CVE-2016-3393.json","https://github.com/WellKnitTech/ThreatActor.info/blob/7036087c2a249dcc213e8af0f4ba71748abc43bb/_malware/ms16-120-cve-2016-3393-0day-exploits.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-3393.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2016.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-3393.csv","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/121398.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0209","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-3298","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 及 Internet Messaging API 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 9至11版本及Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1中的Internet Messaging API存在信息泄漏漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对内存中对象处理不当，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网站，利用该漏洞探测目标系统上任意文件的存在状态，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击需用户交互，CVSS评分6.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft已在安全更新3192887中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-3298"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-10-14T02:59:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:45:27Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS16-104 提供的累积安全更新 3192887，该更新修复了 Internet Explorer 9~11 及 Windows Internet Messaging API 中的信息泄漏漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。临时缓解措施：配置 Internet Explorer 将 Internet 区域安全级别设为\"高\"，禁用活动脚本及 ActiveX 控件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93392","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036992","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-118","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-126","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-3298","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-3298.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2016/3xxx/CVE-2016-3298.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-3298","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/microsoft-patches-CVE-2016-3298-second-information-disclosure-zero-day.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2016/3xxx/CVE-2016-3298.json","https://github.com/ctxis/CAPE/blob/dae9fa6a254ecdbabeb7eb0d2389fa63722c1e82/data/yara/memory/cve_2016_3298.yar","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-3298.txt","https://github.com/Ebiquity/CASIE/blob/2c8beef56d48e8de6599891c6a5e0e5f0d82e20c/data/source/267.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-3298.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0209.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0209.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0040","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000155","title":"WordPress wpsolr-search-engine 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 wpsolr-search-engine 插件 7.6 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（Reflected XSS，CWE-79）。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意 URL 并诱使已登录的管理员或用户点击，导致恶意 JavaScript 代码在受害者浏览器中执行，从而窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或篡改页面内容。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互，影响使用该插件的所有 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000155"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:47Z","remediation":"立即将 wpsolr-search-engine 插件升级至最后可用版本 20.1（WordPress 后台插件页面检查更新）；由于该插件已永久关闭且不再维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的 WordPress 搜索插件（如 ElasticPress 或 SearchWP）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，过滤 URL 查询参数中的 `<script>`、`onerror`、`onload` 等 XSS 载荷特征，并对用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93536","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=303","https://wordpress.org/plugins/wpsolr-search-engine","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000155.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000155.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000155.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000155.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000155-2741.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-1000155_2.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2016-1000155-2743.yaml","https://github.com/daffainfo/my-nuclei-templates/blob/594182b8a15f94de7466e1b12620e402fef1580f/CVE-2016-1000155.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000155_24.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/05/Reports/xssReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0039","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000154","title":"WordPress Whizz Plugin 1.0.7 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Whizz 插件 1.0.7 版本存在反射型跨站脚本攻击（Reflected XSS）漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 URL 参数向目标页面注入恶意 JavaScript 脚本。当已登录 WordPress 后台的管理员或普通用户点击该恶意链接时，脚本会在用户浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改。该漏洞源于插件对用户输入参数缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击条件为诱导用户点击恶意链接，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000154"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:46Z","remediation":"立即删除或停用 WordPress 插件 Whizz，该插件已长期未更新且官方已不再维护。如仍需使用类似功能，请替换为其他活跃维护的 WordPress 图片/幻灯片插件。同时升级 WordPress 至最新版本，并安装 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence）拦截 XSS 攻击载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93538","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=112","https://wordpress.org/plugins/whizz","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000154.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000154.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000154.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000154.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000154.js","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-1000154_1.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000154-2738.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2016-1000154_5.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000154-2739.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000154-b769455fd0c730ed61ea4c4558409326.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0038","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000153","title":"WordPress tidio-gallery 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress tidio-gallery 插件 1.1 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞位于插件处理用户输入时未进行充分的过滤与转义。远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL，诱使用户点击后，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000153"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:46Z","remediation":"该插件已于 2014 年 9 月从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护，无安全更新可用。建议立即在 WordPress 后台卸载 tidio-gallery 插件，并删除所有相关文件。如必须保留使用，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则过滤 ?galleryId= 等参数中的 <script> 等 XSS 载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93543","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=427","https://wordpress.org/plugins/tidio-gallery","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000153.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000153.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000153.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000153.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2016-1000153-2734.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-1000153.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2016-1000153.yaml","https://github.com/daffainfo/my-nuclei-templates/blob/594182b8a15f94de7466e1b12620e402fef1580f/CVE-2016-1000153.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000153.json","https://github.com/0ahmad0makki0/MyNuclei.V1.0/blob/38542bcf3aeb106084ec17df3981ddf081c73710/Public/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000153.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0037","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000152","title":"WordPress tidio-form 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 tidio-form 插件 1.0 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理。攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的恶意链接，诱使用户点击后，在浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互。该漏洞影响 tidio-form 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000152"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:46Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台删除 tidio-form 插件（已关闭下架且不再维护），或手动删除 /wp-content/plugins/tidio-form/ 目录。如业务必须保留表单功能，可安装替代插件（如 Contact Form 7、WPForms），同时在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）侧添加规则拦截对 tidio-form 相关路径的恶意查询参数，过滤 <script> 等 XSS 载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93579","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=799","https://wordpress.org/plugins/tidio-form","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000152.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000152.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000152.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000152.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000152-2729.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops