"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0034","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000146","title":"WordPress pondol-formmail 插件反射跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 pondol-formmail 插件 1.1 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（Reflected XSS，CWE-79）。攻击者无需认证即可通过构造恶意 URL 并诱导用户点击，将恶意 JavaScript 代码注入到响应页面中，导致攻击者在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，可窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或篡改页面内容。该漏洞利用条件低，仅需用户交互（点击链接），影响 WordPress 站点中安装了该插件的环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000146"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:45Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 pondol-formmail 插件（v1.1 已不再维护），该插件存在反射型 XSS 漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 URL 窃取用户 Cookie 或会话令牌。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的表单插件（如 Contact Form 7、WPForms），并确保 WordPress 核心及所有插件保持最新版本。如必须使用，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则过滤 `_wpnonce` 等参数中的恶意脚本代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93584","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=787","https://wordpress.org/plugins/pondol-formmail","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000146.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000146.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000146.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000146.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000146-2720.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000146-2718.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2016-1000146.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-1000146_1.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2016-1000146-2720.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000146.js","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2016-1000146.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0032","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000143","title":"WordPress photoxhibit 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 photoxhibit 插件 2.1.8 版本存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分过滤与转义。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制 URL 并诱使目标用户点击，在用户浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击需用户交互，影响运行该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000143"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:45Z","remediation":"立即从 WordPress 后台插件管理页面删除 PhotoXhibit 插件（该插件已于 2013 年关闭下架，开发者已停止维护，无补丁可用），并替换为仍在维护的相册插件（如 NextGEN Gallery 或 FooGallery），以彻底消除反射型 XSS 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93803","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=780","https://wordpress.org/plugins/photoxhibit","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000143.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000143.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000143.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000143.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000143-2715.yaml","