-10T20:59:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:45Z","remediation":"立即卸载 page-layout-builder 插件（v1.9.3 及所有版本），该插件已于 2016 年 4 月从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护。替换为受支持的页面构建插件，如 Gutenberg 原生编辑器或 Elementor。如无法立即替换，在 WAF 或反向代理层添加规则，过滤对 /wp-content/plugins/page-layout-builder/ 路径下 URL 参数中的 <script>、onerror、onload 等 XSS 攻击载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93804","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=358","https://wordpress.org/plugins/page-layout-builder","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000141.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000141.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000141.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000141.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000141.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-1000141_8.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2016-1000141.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0f0b9d6a392d0d58ac48900af57e1d0e8f253633/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-10001xx/CVE-2016-1000141.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2016-1000141-2711.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv","https://github.com/Kaiz7703/My_Tools/blob/a1512a65d2b2896963bf459cd1edcdab0a9bdcba/nuclei/2016/CVE-2016-1000141.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0028","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000140","title":"WordPress new-year-firework 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 new-year-firework 1.1.9 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理。攻击者可利用该漏洞向目标用户发送特制的恶意链接，当用户点击链接后，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致攻击者能够窃取会话凭证、劫持用户会话或篡改页面内容。攻击条件要求用户交互（点击链接），影响范围涉及机密性与完整性，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000140"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-10T20:59:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:45Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台插件管理页面删除并卸载 new-year-firework 插件（该插件已从官方仓库下架且不再维护）。如暂时无法删除，可在 Nginx/Apache 或 WAF 中添加规则，拦截 URL 查询参数中包含 `<script>`、`onerror`、`alert(` 等 XSS 载荷的请求，并启用 Content-Security-Policy 头限制内联脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/93817","http://www.vapidlabs.com/wp/wp_advisory.php?v=453","https://wordpress.org/plugins/new-year-firework","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000140.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1000140.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1000140.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/1000xxx/CVE-2016-1000140.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2016-1000140-2703.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-1000140.js","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2016-1000140-2704.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nu